          "title": {
            "zh": "拒绝临时加班",
            "en": "Declining Extra Hours"
          },
          "hook": {
            "zh": "下班前十分钟，经理让你今晚留下帮忙，而你早有安排。",
            "en": "Ten minutes before you leave, your manager asks you to stay late — again."
          },
          "background": {
            "zh": "已经是这个月第三次。今晚你答应了去参加父亲的生日晚餐。经理 Michael 走过来，语气客气但带着「你不会拒绝吧」的预期，说客户明早要看方案，需要你今晚改完。团队里新同事 Lily 就坐在旁边。",
            "en": "It's the third time this month. Tonight you promised to be at your father's birthday dinner. Michael, your manager, walks over, polite but clearly expecting a yes: the client needs the deck by tomorrow morning. Lily, a new teammate, sits within earshot."
          },
